// Tessellation demo scene
// LEGEND:
// - NewObject [required] = A new object and the number of instances to create
// - StaticLODs [required] = The number of static LODs (at least 3) and their .obj file paths
// - Bezier [at least 1 required] = The path to the .bpt file containing the bezier mesh and 0/1 based on whether or not the 
// 									patches are in inverse order
// - DynamicBaseLOD [optional] = The lod number to subdivide when using the DYNAMIC method (default: max lod)
// - Position [optional] = 3 floats defining the object's position in the world
// - PositionOffset [optional] = 3 floats defining how to change the position of each instance of the object
// - Rotation [optional] = 3 floats defining the object's rotation angle around each axis (x, y, z)
// - RotationOffset [optional] = 3 floats defining how to change the rotation of each instance of the object around each axis (x, y, z)
// - Scale [optional] = 3 floats scale of the object around 3 axes
// - MinMaxDistance [optional] = 2 floats defining the min-max distance at which to display LOD0 and the highest LOD
// - TessExtremesOuter [optional] = 4 floats that represent the min-max outer tessellation levels for the DYNAMIC and 
// 									BEZIER techniques (in this order)
// - TessExtremesInner [optional] = 4 floats that represent the min-max inner tessellation levels for the DYNAMIC and 
// 									BEZIER techniques (in this order)
// - EarlyBackfaceCulling [optional] = 0/1 depending on whether to activate early backface culling on the object (default: 1)
// - StaticBuffer [optional] = a float describing the buffer size for LOD boundaries when moving backwards, used to avoid flickering
// - EndObject [required] = Ends the object

NewObject 5
StaticLODs 3 ./models/teapot/teapot_surface0.obj ./models/teapot/teapot_surface1.obj ./models/teapot/teapot_surface2.obj
Bezier ./models/teapot/teapot_bezier.bpt 0
Position 0.0 -2.0 0.0
PositionOffset 0.0 0.0 -10.0
MinMaxDistance 13.0 35.0
TessExtremesOuter 1.0 14.5 3.0 64.0
TessExtremesInner 1.0 2.0 3.0 50.0
EarlyBackfaceCulling 0
EndObject

NewObject 5
StaticLODs 4 ./models/gumbo/gumbo_surface0.obj ./models/gumbo/gumbo_surface1.obj ./models/gumbo/gumbo_surface2.obj ./models/gumbo/gumbo_surface3.obj
Bezier ./models/gumbo/gumbo.bpt 0 
Bezier ./models/gumbo/gumbo_ear.bpt 1
Position 10.0 -2.0 3.0
PositionOffset 0.0 0.0 -10.0
Rotation -90.0 0.0 90.0
Scale 0.2 0.2 0.2
MinMaxDistance 13.0 35.0
TessExtremesOuter 1.0 6.0 2.0 32.0
TessExtremesInner 1.0 3.0 2.0 24.0
EndObject

NewObject 5
StaticLODs 4 ./models/teaspoon/teaspoon_surface0.obj ./models/teaspoon/teaspoon_surface1.obj ./models/teaspoon/teaspoon_surface2.obj ./models/teaspoon/teaspoon_surface3.obj
Bezier ./models/teaspoon/teaspoon_bezier.bpt 0
Position -10.0 -1.8 -2.0
PositionOffset 0.0 0.0 -10.0
Rotation -90.0 0.0 0.0
Scale 4.0 4.0 4.0
MinMaxDistance 13.0 35.0
TessExtremesOuter 0.1 8.0 3.0 64.0
TessExtremesInner 1.0 2.0 3.0 32.0
EndObject
